      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A 45‑minute ride on the historic steam train lets visitors experience the same locomotive technology that once ferried goods along the Great Conestoga Road.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://strasburgpa.com/about",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The borough grew around the Old Conestoga Road, a path in use by 1714 that later became the Strasburg Road and now Pennsylvania Route 741.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
